                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "does this break the netipmid usage of this function?\n\nTo make API changes like this, it would be better to add a new function that calls the first with an argument or use a default argument. Given the simplicity of this case, it would be better to use a default argument. Then netipmid can use this without any change."
                },
